    "published": "2015-12-07T10:00:51.000Z",
    "title": "スタジオからメリクリ〜♪",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/2015007.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170323081734/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/2015007.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "adbf201c3b72.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/3/2/32cf8b8e.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家好，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, I'm Kano"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "235cc7ea408b.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_biccuri02.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "すっかり街はクリスマスですね。スタジオも今日行くとこんな感じでクリスマスでした。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "街上已经完全是圣诞气氛了呢。今天去录音室一看，那里也布置成了这样充满圣诞气息的样子。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The whole town is in full Christmas mode, isn't it. The studio was Christmassy like this when I went today."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "私のクリスマスはどんなクリスマスですかって？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "问我“你的圣诞节是什么样的圣诞节”？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What kind of Christmas will mine be, you ask?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "＼ 締め切り日でっす^o^ ／"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "＼ 就是截止日没错 ^o^ ／"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "＼ It's a deadline day! ^o^ ／"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ここ数年、ずっとそんな感じなので大丈夫です。べべべ、別に悲しくも寂しくも寒くもないんです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这几年一直都是这副光景，所以没关系。才、才、才不觉得伤心、寂寞，也不觉得冷呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's been like that for the past few years, so I'm fine. I-I-It's not that I'm sad or lonely or cold or anything."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "でもせっかくのクリスマスで、せっかくのお誕生日（24日なので正確にはイブ）なので美味しいケーキは食べたいなって思ってます。あわよくば、お友達誘って鍋パとか…あ、デート？24日以降も忘年会とかあって無理？あ、なるほど。なるほどね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "不过难得赶上圣诞节，又难得是我的生日（因为生日是24号，准确说是平安夜），所以还是想吃好吃的蛋糕呀。运气好的话，叫上朋友搞个火锅派对什么的……啊，约会？24号之后还有忘年会什么的，排不开？啊，原来如此。原来如此啊。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "But since it's Christmas, and since it's my birthday (the 24th, so strictly it's Christmas Eve), I do want to eat some delicious cake. If possible, maybe invite friends for a hot pot party... oh, a date? After the 24th there are year-end parties and such, so no? Ah, I see. I see."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "よーし、すべての淡い期待を捨てて冬コミの準備に集中するぞー！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好——把那些不切实际的期待统统丢掉，专心准备冬Comiket吧！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All right, I'll throw away all my faint hopes and focus on preparing for Winter Comiket!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みなさま、よいクリスマスとお正月をお過ごしください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "祝大家度过一个愉快的圣诞节和新年。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Everyone, have a wonderful Christmas and New Year."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "来自录音室的圣诞快乐～♪",
    "titleEn": "Merry Christmas from the Studio~♪"
  },
